---
source: crates/biome_formatter_test/src/snapshot_builder.rs
info: yaml/comment/comment_spacing/entries.yaml
---

# Input

```yaml
? explicit # after explicit key
: value # after explicit value
group: &a !!map # first middle comment
  # second middle comment
  b: 1
flow_keys: {
  key: # after flow key colon
    value,
  other: 2 # after flow entry
}
colon_line: { ? key # after explicit flow key
  : # after flow colon
    value }
...  # after document end

```


# Options

```json
{
  "yaml": {
    "formatter": {
      "commentSpacing": 4
    }
  }
}
```

# Formatted

```yaml
explicit:    # after explicit key
  value    # after explicit value
group: !!map &a
  # first middle comment
  # second middle comment
  b: 1
flow_keys: {
    ? key    # after flow key colon
    : value,
    other: 2,    # after flow entry
  }
colon_line: { ? key    # after explicit flow key
    :    # after flow colon
      value }
...    # after document end

```
